| Key Partners      | Key Activities    | Value Proposition    |
|                   |                   |                      |
+-------------------+-------------------+----------------------+
| Key Resources     |                   | Customer             |
|                   |                   | Relationships        |
+-------------------+-------------------+----------------------+
| Cost Structure    | Revenue Streams   | Customer Segments    |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
| Channels                                             |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
